  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livestock Feed Production Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Location: Chipata, Eastern Province, Zambia.Summary: USADF grant will be used to improve the processing capacity of Chipata DFA to include increase in purchase of raw materials, purchase of an oil expeller and livestock feed processing machine. This grant will also be used to construct a warehouse for storing raw materials.</narrative>
  </description>
